# EXECUTION LOOP

Work unit: **{{WORK_UNIT}}**. `state/state.json` is canonical for the queue and progress.

## Unit loop

```text
1. PICK       Select one queued unit. Keep at most one unit in progress.
2. GUARD      Check budget and approval gates. At 80%, checkpoint instead of starting work.
3. DEFINE     Resolve the skill's evaluator link and scope=task pass condition. Do not execute without one.
4. EXECUTE    Complete the unit. Deterministic boundary: {{DETERMINISTIC_BOUNDARY}}
5. EVALUATE   Run the task evaluator through EVAL-LOOP; preserve raw evidence and the verdict.
6. RECOVER    On fail, classify and recover through RECOVERY-PLAYBOOK. Count one stable failure key per incident.
7. RECORD     For each completed unit, use one state transaction to update current_unit; increment
              units_since_full exactly once; set cooldown_remaining_units = max(0, n-1);
              then update recent and rolling raw task evidence, budget, and the append-only journal.
              Do not add an LLM call.
8. INCIDENT   On a false-to-true coldstart_fail transition, add coldstart-fail once to pending_events.
              On a pass-to-fail parity transition, add parity-fail once.
9. CHECK      At the task boundary, run only this read-only checker:
              python {{HARNESS_ROOT}}/triggers/check_self_evaluation.py {{HARNESS_ROOT}}
10. ROUTE     input-invalid:* -> no effect evaluation or LLM; verify, repair, then recheck.
              adapter-change|parity-fail -> require parity before effect evaluation.
              none -> stop or select the next unit.
              targeted -> run only reason-mapped deterministic metrics from evaluation/suites/targeted.json.
              full -> run HARNESS-EVAL-LOOP.
11. ACK       After a completed targeted or full run, call the HARNESS-EVAL-LOOP recorder.
              Never start IMPROVE-LOOP from the checker result alone.
```

## Cost and state rules

- The checker changes no files and returns only compact `none|targeted|full` JSON. It does not invoke an LLM judge or evaluation skill.
- Only `targeted.json` maps `cost-regression|retry-pressure|deterministic-sample` to deterministic metrics. Do not invent a targeted LLM evaluation.
- Budget and cooldown defer only optional targeted or full evaluation; they never defer mandatory full evaluation.
- Call the recorder only after a completed run. A full ACK consumes only the processed pending events and frozen failure snapshot, then updates managed hashes so the same signal does not repeat.
- Run the task evaluator for every unit, regardless of the self-evaluation decision.

## Invariants

- Never execute without an evaluator, pass without evidence, or bypass a gate.
- Add out-of-queue work to the queue before execution.
- Only the main orchestrator writes the self-evaluation state transaction and recorder state; never use parallel writers.
- Do not interpret `none` or `input-invalid:*` as a request to improve the harness.
